<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan T$5 bln 3-month NCDs average yield 4.74 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan T$5 bln 3-month NCDs average yield 4.74 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank issued T$5 billion in three-month negotiable certificates of deposits on Thursday at an average yield of 4.74 percent, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>Demand totalled T$8.75 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
